'' A bare zstring or wstring through an ALIAS is a variable type to fbc (its keyword check is on
'' the word as written, TKO0996 here): 'type Z as zstring : extern x as Z' is 'extern char
'' x[1]', sizeof 1 (fbc-modern 1.20). tiko lowered the global to 'external global void' and
'' clang refused it (TKO0113). Now it is one element's storage, as fbc's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/bare-str-alias.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: global var agg alias_ver size 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: global var agg s size 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0113
